s_ids CTE in HibernateDataExportStore.createExportQuery\nresolved descendant org units via `ou.path LIKE root.path || '%'`. Because the\nprefix is computed per-row from a joined column rather than a plan-time\nconstant, Postgres can never use an index for this predicate (not even the\nexisting varchar_pattern_ops btree on path) and falls back to a full\nsequential scan of organisationunit on every call.\n\nSince the org unit path-array migration (DHIS2-22095) added `patharray` plus\na GIN index (organisationunit_patharray_gin), and the DB's own\nou_moved_patharray descendant-update trigger already uses the same\ncontainment idiom, switch this query to `ou.patharray @\u003e root.patharray`.\n\nLive-validated via EXPLAIN ANALYZE against production data (dataValueSets\nexport with children=true): 260.6ms -\u003e 18.1ms (14.4x), same 643-row result,\nseq scan replaced by a Bitmap Index Scan on organisationunit_patharray_gin.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"3fddd11881f5e29d2d27176397327110c7ff899a","tree_id":"e923255cdf88152702c21baa1713b7ff21c35c50","timestamp":"2026-09-17T11:13:05Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs"